k and side, an off-white translucent robe slipping from both shoulders into loose billowing sleeves, and ivory wide-leg trousers tied at the waist with red cords and hanging tassels. Her left hand lifts the heavy wine-red curtain beside her face while her right hand touches an open calligraphy book; on the table are a candle in a glass holder, ink brush, small red bowl, and aged pages. Background has carved lattice windows, dark wooden beams, a canopied bed with crimson patterned silk, warm candlelight and soft lantern glow creating rim light, gentle volumetric illumination, deep shadows, cozy intimate atmosphere; eye-level medium shot, centered vertical composition, shallow depth of field, intricate fabric texture, elegant historical Chinese aesthetic."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "positive"}, "name": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy positive", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [260, 130], "pos": [-1000, 1760], "id": 15, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "450b1ce4ce43b2280521c87f5fa388a898fb2ad2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"positive": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy positive"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [13], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 10, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 11, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "type": "VAEDecode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [300, 50], "pos": [-560, 2290], "id": 8, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.32.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "model"